# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages. Other hosts should send equivalent headers.
# A deployment published with --threads also gets the two cross-origin isolation headers here (publish.py adds
# them); without them it plays on one thread.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets-manifest.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
